        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the user's request, I need to create a Python file named `profile_claims.py` that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. I will choose Google as the provider for this task, as it is a well-known and widely used service for handling user authentication and profile data. The code will use the Google People API to fetch user profile data and normalize it. </thinking>\n",
